Overall Kya Kar Raha Hai Code?

Ye Java Compute Node incoming XML message me se MsgType check karta hai. Uske basis pe:

Message ID (BizMsgIdr),

Receiver IFSC Code (RcvrIfsc ya MmId),

Original Message ID (OrgnlMsgId)


...jaise fields extract karta hai.

Phir ye fields Global Environment ke andar "MsgType", "UniqueId", aur "IFSCDetails" folders me daal deta hai.

Ye Global Environment ka use flow ke aage ke nodes karte hain further processing ke liye.
